          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "high-corner",
      "hypothesis": "highHz across 1k-10k at fixed ratio separates 'how much darker' from 'where the darkening starts' (stage 05-damping.md, 'Worth sweeping early'); the Reference's own 4000 Hz corner sits between these two points.",
