    {
      "name": "low-corner",
      "hypothesis": "The low shelf's corner placement, the low-frequency counterpart to high-corner: the Reference's own lowRatio (1.0, bypassed) would make a corner move inaudible, so both points also fix lowRatio at a shared non-unity value.",
